sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant AuthController
    participant AuthService
    participant AuthManager as AuthenticationManager
    participant CUDS as CustomUserDetailsService
    participant Encoder as BCryptPasswordEncoder
    participant JwtUtil
    participant JwtFilter as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant UserRepo as UserRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Client,DB: Registration flow (POST /api/auth/signup)
    Client->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/signup (RegisterRequest)
    AuthController->>AuthService: register(request)
    AuthService->>UserRepo: existsByUsername / existsByMail
    UserRepo->>DB: SELECT COUNT(u) ...
    DB-->>UserRepo: count
    UserRepo-->>AuthService: boolean
    AuthService->>Encoder: encode(rawPassword)
    Encoder-->>AuthService: bcrypt hash
    AuthService->>UserRepo: save(user)
    UserRepo->>DB: INSERT user (+ location)
    DB-->>UserRepo: saved User
    UserRepo-->>AuthService: User
    AuthService-->>AuthController: UserDTO
    AuthController-->>Client: 201 Created (UserDTO)

    Note over Client,DB: Login flow (POST /api/auth/signin)
    Client->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/signin (LoginDTO)
    AuthController->>AuthService: login(request)
    AuthService->>AuthManager: authenticate(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken)
    AuthManager->>CUDS: loadUserByUsername(username)
    CUDS->>UserRepo: findByUsernameOrEmail(username)
    UserRepo->>DB: SELECT u WHERE username OR mail
    DB-->>UserRepo: User (hashed password)
    UserRepo-->>CUDS: User
    CUDS-->>AuthManager: UserDetails
    AuthManager->>Encoder: matches(rawPassword, storedHash)
    Encoder-->>AuthManager: true / false
    alt credentials valid
        AuthManager-->>AuthService: Authentication
        AuthService->>JwtUtil: generateToken(username)
        JwtUtil-->>AuthService: signed JWT (HMAC256)
        AuthService->>UserRepo: findByUsernameOrEmailDTO(username)
        UserRepo->>DB: SELECT new UserDTO ...
        DB-->>UserRepo: UserDTO
        UserRepo-->>AuthService: UserDTO
        AuthService-->>AuthController: LoginResponseDTO (token + user + message)
        AuthController-->>Client: 200 OK (token, user, "Login successful")
    else BadCredentialsException
        AuthService-->>AuthController: RuntimeException("Invalid username or password")
        AuthController-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized (message)
    end

    Note over Client,DB: Authenticated request to a protected route
    Client->>JwtFilter: GET /api/... (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
    JwtFilter->>JwtUtil: getUsernameFromToken(token)
    JwtUtil-->>JwtFilter: username (or null)
    alt username present and no existing authentication
        JwtFilter->>CUDS: loadUserByUsername(username)
        CUDS->>UserRepo: findByUsernameOrEmail(username)
        UserRepo->>DB: SELECT u WHERE username OR mail
        DB-->>UserRepo: User
        UserRepo-->>CUDS: User
        CUDS-->>JwtFilter: UserDetails
        JwtFilter->>JwtUtil: validateToken(token)
        JwtUtil-->>JwtFilter: true / false
        alt token valid
            JwtFilter->>JwtFilter: set SecurityContext (UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken)
        end
    end
    JwtFilter->>JwtFilter: filterChain.doFilter(request, response)
    JwtFilter-->>Client: protected resource (200) or 401/403 if unauthenticated
